Shatter the spacetime continuum around yourself, inflicting [108, 146, 175, 200, 222 (TL1-5; SP 100)] temporal damage to all targets within radius 10. Any atrophy stacks will be consumed to steal time from your victims, inflicting an additional [18, 24, 29, 33, 37 (TL1-5; SP 100)] temporal damage and granting you [1%, 3%, 4%, 5%, 7% (TL1-5)] of a turn per stack (but no more than 3 turns).

The damage will scale with your Spellpower.
